  exerciseTitle: Scenario (To-Do)
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459397
  exerciseText: 'Save System can store any data you want, in this case storing resource
    amounts and objects in the world.


    In this Scenario the player can walk
    around and gather resources. Then they can save the state of the game, and with
    another key load the previously saved game state which will load the amounts
    and any objects placed in the world.


    <b>NOTE: Completing this Exercise
    will DELETE all the files, so if you want to keep your own personal implementation
    of this System then make a BACKUP before clicking on Complete Exercise!</b>'
